  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-partner trust Fund established in 2016 to support women&#x2019;s participation in peace and security and humanitarian processes through channelling direct and flexible funding to civil society organizations in crisis settings. WPHF supports a wide range of interventions relating to NAP1325, conflict prevention, humanitarian response, women&#x2019;s participation in peace processes, protection against SGBV and human rights violations, as well as peacebuilding and recovery.</narrative>
